---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms"
  description="Usage terms and limitations for InfraTrove's free browser-based tools."
>
  <article class="container prose">
    <div class="eyebrow">Last updated · October 24, 2026</div>
    <h1>Terms of use.</h1>
    <p>
      InfraTrove provides free utilities for general technical tasks. You are
      responsible for checking results before using them in production,
      security-sensitive work or other consequential decisions.
    </p>
    <h2>Limitations</h2>
    <p>
      Tools have documented input limits and supported formats. A cron preview
      does not guarantee how another scheduler behaves. A random identifier does
      not guarantee uniqueness. Encoded data is not encrypted.
    </p>
    <h2>Availability</h2>
    <p>
      The service is provided as available, without guarantees of uninterrupted
      operation or suitability for a particular purpose. Features and limits may
      change. Nothing in these terms excludes rights that cannot legally be
      excluded.
    </p>
    <h2>Responsible use</h2>
    <p>
      Do not attempt to disrupt the service or misuse it in violation of
      applicable law. Avoid entering data on a device or browser you do not
      trust.
    </p>
    <p>
      These terms and the operator's contact details require review before
      public launch. See <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a> for data handling.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
